==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Treat this as an [[Empire of Cats]] stage. This can be beat by the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]], but you can bring [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or other area attackers.

